mode: "100644"
text: "# Examples — Reels scripts\n\nWorked scripts as production docs (shot · on-screen text · spoken · audio · timing), each with a\n3-second hook, a muted-first design, a sends answer, IG keywords, and a cover brief — plus a\n\"TikTok reupload\" version for contrast. Voice is the blunt indie-founder voice from earlier skills\n(short, dry, no exclamation marks, concrete). Your output uses the loaded `voice.md`.\n\n---\n\n## Example 1 — Talking head / story (filmed) · ~30s · goal: reach + sends\n\n**Concept:** we deleted our most-requested feature; the boring button won.\n**Audio:** original (your voice). **Sends answer:** PMs/founders forward it to the teammate pushing\nthe loud feature request. **Cover brief:** custom cover, \"We deleted our #1 feature\" in bold text,\ngrid-safe center.\n\n| Time | Shot | On-screen text | Spoken |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 0:00–0:03 | Close, mid-sentence, to camera | **\"We deleted our #1 requested feature.\"** | \"We spent six months on the feature everyone asked for. Then we deleted it.\" |\n| 0:03–0:10 | Same, quick cut | \"nobody used it\" | \"Every sales call, people begged for it. We shipped it. Nobody touched it.\" |\n| 0:10–0:20 | Slight push-in | \"the boring button won\" | \"What they actually used was a tiny export button we kept ignoring. Built it in two days. Most-used thing we have.\" |\n| 0:20–0:28 | Cut, direct | \"watch what they DO\" | \"People tell you what sounds good and do something else. So now we watch behavior, not surveys.\" |\n| 0:28–0:30 | Back to opener framing | \"so we deleted it.\" | \"Which is how we ended up deleting our most-requested feature.\" ← loops to 0:00 |\n\n**Muted check:** the five text lines tell the whole story without audio.\n**Loop:** the last line flows back into the first frame.\n**IG SEO:** \"product feature\", \"SaaS\" spoken in the first 3 seconds + on-screen; caption first\nsentence: \"How we decide what to build for our SaaS — behavior over feature requests.\" 3–5 topic\nhashtags (#buildinpublic #saas #productmanagement). Keyword cluster → `instagram-seo`.\n**Caption → `caption-writer`. Publish (cover, safe zone) → `instagram-reels-publishing`.\nSchedule → `scheduling-and-queue`.**\n\n---\n\n## Example 2 — Faceless listicle (AI b-roll + voiceover) · ~20s · goal: sends + saves\n\n**Concept:** 3 tools that replaced a $200/mo stack. **Format:** faceless, voiceover over Veo b-roll.\n**Audio:** voiceover in edit + a trending upbeat track named for **native add-in-app**, cuts on the\nbeat. **Sends answer:** forwarded to the friend who complains about tool costs; saved as a\nreference. **Cover brief:** frame at 0:00 with the \"$200/mo\" text visible, centered.\n\n| Time | Shot (Veo b-roll) | On-screen text | Voiceover |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 0:00–0:03 | Fast push-in on a cluttered dashboard | **\"3 tools that killed my $200/mo stack\"** | \"Three tools that replaced two hundred dollars a month.\" |\n| 0:03–0:08 | Tool 1 in use | \"1. ___ (free)\" | \"One — handles all my scheduling. Free tier covers it.\" |\n| 0:08–0:13 | Tool 2 | \"2. ___\" | \"Two — does what I paid fifty bucks for.\" |\n| 0:13–0:18 | Tool 3 | \"3. ___ (the sleeper)\" | \"Three — the one nobody talks about. Wait for this one.\" ← open loop paid off |\n| 0:18–0:20 | Back to first frame | \"send this to your cofounder\" | \"Send it to whoever pays the invoices.\" |\n\n**Muted check:** numbers + labels carry it silently; captions burned in, safe-zone placed.\n**Rewatch trigger:** three tools in 20 seconds — one watch isn't enough to note them all.\n**Veo note:** b-roll only, per `veo-prompt-pack.md`; AI-labeling per Meta's rules (manual — not\nauto-disclosed on Instagram). Export clean, no watermarks.\n\n---\n\n## Contrast — the TikTok reupload (do NOT do this)\n\n- The same video exported from TikTok, **watermark in the corner**.\n- Hook written for sound-on only; no on-screen text for the muted majority.\n- No cover chosen — the grid shows a random mid-word frame.\n\n→ The watermark and originality gates throttle it before ranking; the mute-blind hook loses the\nfeed; the grid frame wastes the profile visit. Re-cut a clean native version instead —\n`cross-platform-repurposing`.\n\n---\n\n## What the good examples share\n\n- A **3-second hook** on all three channels, with the on-screen text carrying it **on mute**.\n- **Fast pace, no intro tax**, a visual change every ~2–4s, a **loop/rewatch trigger**.\n- A concrete **sends answer** (who forwards it, to whom, why).\n- An **audio choice** named — and flagged **native add-in-app** when it's IG-library audio.\n- **IG keywords** in the first 3 spoken seconds + on-screen + caption; a **cover brief**.\n- Original, watermark-free, on-voice; truthful hook; no fabricated stats; AI-labeling where generated.\n"
